ELEMENT LOAD
2033 TO 2752 PR GZ 383
2753 TO 3472 PR GZ -383
3473 TO 3688 PR GX 383
3689 TO 3904 PR GX -383
LOAD 10 LOADTYPE Live  TITLE LL2 CONSTRUCTION SURCHARGE 20.0 KN/M2
ELEMENT LOAD
1081 TO 2032 PR GY -20
* lateral component K0 x q = 0.5 x 20.0 = 10.0 kN/m2, uniform over
* the full wall height, inward on all four external walls.
2033 TO 2752 PR GZ 10
2753 TO 3472 PR GZ -10
3473 TO 3688 PR GX 10
3689 TO 3904 PR GX -10
*
LOAD 11 LOADTYPE None  TITLE BL3 BLAST IN STAIR SHAFT ON W6 AND W7 383 KN/M2
ELEMENT LOAD
* FINDING F1 / MOD M1.  The shaft is open to atmosphere through the roof void, the
* headhouse and the covered stairwell; fill time V/(A.c) = 105/(3.3 x 340) = 0.094 s
* against td 0.13-1.33 s, so it EQUALISES TO FULL p_so.  W6 and W7 stand in the same
* plane as the 7-bar blast doors and take the full 383 kN/m2, acting OUT of the shaft.
4121 TO 4336 PR GX -383
4337 TO 4552 PR GX 383
*
* --------------------------- COMBINATIONS ---------------------------
LOAD COMB 101 ULS STATIC  1.5(DL+LL+EARTH+WATER)
1 1.5 2 1.5 3 1.5 4 1.5 6 1.5 7 1.5 5 1.5
LOAD COMB 102 ULS UPLIFT  0.9DL + 1.5 HYDROSTATIC
1 0.9 2 0.9 7 1.5
LOAD COMB 103 BLAST  1.0(DL + EARTH + WATER + BLAST)  GAMMA = 1.0
1 1.0 2 1.0 3 1.0 5 1.0 6 1.0 7 1.0 8 1.0 9 1.0 11 1.0
LOAD COMB 104 SLS  1.0(DL+LL+EARTH+WATER)  FOR CRACK WIDTH TO IS 3370
1 1.0 2 1.0 3 1.0 4 1.0 5 1.0 6 1.0 7 1.0
LOAD COMB 105 CONSTRUCTION  1.5(DL + EARTH + WATER + SURCHARGE)
1 1.5 2 1.5 6 1.5 7 1.5 10 1.5
*
* IS 4991 Cl 11.1 - 'Wind or earthquake forces shall not be assumed to occur
*   simultaneously with blast effects.'  Hence no wind or seismic case here.
* IS 4991 Cl 11.2 - 'No live load shall be considered on roof at the time of
*   blast.'  Hence LOAD 4 and LOAD 10 do not appear in COMB 103.
* LOAD 10 is used in COMB 105, the backfilling / plant-traffic stage.
*
* NOTE ON COMB 102 - the ELASTIC MAT springs take TENSION, so this model will
* never show the raft lifting off.  Global flotation must be checked BY HAND on
* the REAL 22.000 x 6.200 = 136.40 m2 underside, not on the plate model's
* mid-surface area of 119.84 m2.  See the build guides.
*
PERFORM ANALYSIS PRINT STATICS CHECK
*
PRINT SUPPORT REACTION LIST 1 TO 1159
START CONCRETE DESIGN
CODE INDIAN
FC 35000 ALL
FYMAIN 500000 ALL
DESIGN ELEMENT 2033 TO 2752 3473 TO 3688
END CONCRETE DESIGN
FINISH
